*.swp
*.swo

# Local agent, MCP, and review artifacts. Never publish these.
.impeccable/
.shots/
.zion-mcp/
.zcode/

# Private writing. Publish READMEs only.
*.md
!README.md
!README.zh-CN.md
reference/
